@startuml
title Class structure — Run the day from a phone
class EventHub {
  +Id : Guid
  +EventId : Guid
  +UpdateBanner : string?
  +PostUpdate(text, now)
  +ClearUpdate(now)
  +FillSection(kind, json, now)
}
class HubQuickEditsHandler {
  +SetUpdateAsync(eventId, command)
  +ClearUpdateAsync(eventId)
  +MoveSessionAsync(eventId, command)
}
class SetHubUpdateCommand <<record>> {
  +Text : string?
}
class MoveHubSessionCommand <<record>> {
  +Index : int?
  +StartsAt : DateTimeOffset?
  +ShiftLater : bool
}
class AgendaShift <<static>> {
  +Move(agenda, links, index, startsAt, shiftLater) : (AgendaContent, LinksContent?)
}
class EventHubDto <<record>> {
  +UpdateBanner : string?
}
HubQuickEditsHandler --> EventHub
HubQuickEditsHandler ..> SetHubUpdateCommand
HubQuickEditsHandler ..> MoveHubSessionCommand
HubQuickEditsHandler ..> AgendaShift
@enduml
